License:  MIT (below)

Copied:   parser.go, spec.go and constantdelay.go, with their tests
          parser_test.go, spec_test.go and constantdelay_test.go. The
          Schedule interface comes from cron.go and the spec format
          description in the package comment from doc.go.

Not used: the job runner (Cron, Entry, the job chains, the logger and the
          runner options of cron.go, chain.go, logger.go and option.go).
          chok does not depend on the robfig/cron module.

Changes:  - each file starts with the copyright line and a pointer here;
          - Parser.Parse returns an error instead of panicking when a
            CRON_TZ= or TZ= prefix has no schedule after it (a test for it
            is in chok_test.go);
          - gofmt -s reformatted two doc comments in parser.go;
          - staticcheck fixes: two redundant bool types in dayMatches
            (spec.go), and time.Time.Equal instead of == in TestActivation
            (spec_test.go).

